<title>USA: Zapez Technologies names Ralph Mele as president.</title>
<headline>Zapez Technologies names Ralph Mele as president.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zapex Technologies Inc, wholly owned by karaoke company XING Inc of Japan, said Wednesday it had named Ralph Mele as its president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Mele was executive vice president at Optivision before taking on the post, it said.</p>
<p>Zapex did noy say whether Mele would replace anyone.</p>
<p>Brother Industries Ltd and Intec Inc are the parent companies of XING.</p>
</text>
